  {
   "id": "IND-RES-001",
   "title": "Every outbound call has an explicit timeout",
   "scope": "architecture",
   "target": "decision",
   "type": "check",
   "severity": "high",
   "tags": [
    "resilience",
    "timeout",
    "failure"
   ],
   "requirement": "Each call to a dependency names a timeout chosen for that dependency, and the design says what the caller does when it fires. Library defaults do not count.",
