   "type": "check",
   "severity": "medium",
   "tags": [
    "resilience",
    "failure",
    "availability"
   ],
   "requirement": "For each dependency the design states what the user sees when it is unavailable, for example a cached answer, a reduced feature, or a clear error, rather than leaving the behaviour to whatever the failure produces.",
